apture the queen with Nxd8, winning Black's most powerful piece.\n\nReason:\nN: d6-f5 delivers a devastating royal fork, simultaneously attacking Black's king on e7 and queen on d8. Since Black must respond to the check by moving the king, I will win the queen on my next move. This is a game-winning tactical blow that leads to a decisive material advantage (gaining a queen is typically worth about 9 points of material). No other move comes close to this immediate tactical win.\n\nAnswer: N: d6-f5"}
