ces (N: b1-c3, etc.) are far too slow given the immediate promotion opportunity.\n\nReason:\nI should promote to a queen immediately. Between f8 and g8, capturing on g8 is superior because:\n- It removes Black's knight (worth 3 points)\n- Total material gain is +11 vs +8\n- Although the queen on g8 is next to the rook on h8, the rook cannot immediately capture it as that would be an illegal move (the queen would be protected or the king is in the way)\n- A new queen with such overwhelming material advantage should lead to victory\n\nAnswer: P: f7-g8-q"}
