s Black to react while keeping my queen actively placed and limiting Black's counterplay options.\n\nReason: Q: g8-g5 gives check to the exposed Black king on f5, forcing Black's response and maintaining maximum pressure. This keeps the initiative firmly in my hands and doesn't allow Black any time to consolidate their scattered pieces. The queen will remain actively placed after the king moves, continuing to dominate the board.\n\nAnswer: Q: g8-g5"}
