ongest move because:\n- It immediately attacks the undefended b4 pawn\n- Activates my rook from a passive square\n- Puts Black on the defensive\n- The rook can potentially infiltrate Black's position along the b-file or first rank\n- Forces Black to react to the threat rather than improving their position\n\nAnswer: R: a1-b1"}
